From 4eb6a0ae0c9a50cfa564f45dbb665f46549d646d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:59:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v31.2: bounded continuations, documented X routes,
 page-discovery conformance

- run_manager: a step that is resumed MAX_ADAPTIVE_CONTINUATIONS_WITHOUT_PROGRESS
  (3) times at the same durable fingerprint is closed honestly (unfinished
  comment passes -> shortfall with reason) and the run proceeds to analysis.
  Production run 20260925T002306Z-65236947 looped for 8h+ without this.
- X comments: back to documented mode=replies/replyTweetIds (thread mode has
  undocumented semantics and never finished in production); rollout v4
- X page discovery: mode 'profile' is not a mode value -> profileTweets
- Instagram page discovery: remove invented skipPinnedPosts
- lifecycle test waits hardened (1s flaked under load)
- tests: test_v31_2_continuation_guard.py (3), page-discovery conformance (3)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FM9VfoHhfyZmxPfBDYfQjP
